    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement a PKCE login flow for public clients using a concrete external provider, I will choose Auth0 as the provider. Auth0 is a popular authentication platform that supports PKCE (Proof Key for Code Exchange) for public clients. I will write the Python code to perform the PKCE login flow using Auth0's SDK. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863098173,
          "start": 1789863091907
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc275ec30017LirhqOV4eblvC",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc275222001Wd7Umc8vXwrDTA",
      "session_id": "ses_f43d8adeaffeCjO5jWWXroYBeX",
