    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file named `profile_claims.py` in the current working directory. The file should contain code that fetches and normalizes federated user profile claims using a concrete external provider. I will use the Google People API as the external provider, which is identifiable by the import of the `googleapiclient` module and the use of the `people.connections.listDirectoryPeople` method. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863086956,
          "start": 1789863084059
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc27401b0012Fli3hbSEapDrT",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc273bd8001IyDYLqfnjEQgTs",
